@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:是刚才希罗离开审判庭的时候掉的东西。<br>|#0202Adv20_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:本来想去送给她的，可是诺亚忘记了。<br>得赶紧给她才行。|#0202Adv20_Noah004| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Smile1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms01_01,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-

[PrintTextModified Text:『有必要那么着急吗？』|#0202Adv20_AnAn004| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL1,ArmR1-Option-All,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR1-Option-All

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚露出了些许落寞的微笑。|#0202Adv20_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:不行，要赶快还给她。<br>毕竟，谁也不知道<br>什么时候就会死掉。|#0202Adv20_Noah005| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:！|#0202Adv20_AnAn005| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Cry1

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚的眼里渗出泪花。|#0202Adv20_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可也死掉了。|#0202Adv20_Noah006| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她夸了诺亚的画好多次呢，<br>还很高兴地过来看诺亚的画……<br>甚至用在自己的直播里……|#0202Adv20_Noah007| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可是她却走了，好难过啊。<br>我说，大家最后都会死掉吗……<br>诺亚不要那样……|#0202Adv20_Noah008| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:……！|#0202Adv20_AnAn006| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:见诺亚抽泣的样子，<br>安安为难地来回踱步。|#0202Adv20_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms01_03,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-

[PrintTextModified Text:"『冷静点。<br>　吾辈相信，不可能所有人都死掉的』|#0202Adv20_AnAn007|" AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Cry1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……可是。|#0202Adv20_Noah009| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安看诺亚还是哭个不停，<br>便拿出一张画。|#0202Adv20_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Cry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL1,ArmR1-Option-All,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR1-Option-All

[PrintTextModified Text:……这张画，怎么了？|#0202Adv20_Noah010| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Smile1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms01_03,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-

[PrintTextModified Text:『是吾辈在焚烧炉里捡到的』|#0202Adv20_AnAn008| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『只有这张画和其他的不一样，看起来格外耀眼』|#0202Adv20_AnAn009| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『这张画，是你画的吗？』|#0202Adv20_AnAn010| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL1,ArmR1-Option-All,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR1-Option-All

[PrintTextModified Text:……嗯。|#0202Adv20_Noah011| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……为什么。|#0202Adv20_AnAn011| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms01_01,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-

[PrintTextModified Text:『为什么要扔掉？』|#0202Adv20_AnAn012| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Flushed1

[PrintTextModified Text:……因为画得很差嘛。|#0202Adv20_Noah012| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL1,ArmR1-Option-All,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR1-Option-All

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚难为情地挠了挠脸颊。|#0202Adv20_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:一点都、不差……！|#0202Adv20_AnAn013| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:……吾辈，喜欢这幅画。|#0202Adv20_AnAn014| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:真的？|#0202Adv20_Noah013| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

