@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚紧紧抱住安安。|#0202Adv20_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚这才好不容易止住了哭泣。<br>安安便放心地微微一笑。|#0202Adv20_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:……你还是笑起来更好看。|#0202Adv20_AnAn015| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:和吾辈一起，体验更多快乐的事吧。|#0202Adv20_AnAn016| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:吾辈会带给诺亚很多很多笑容的。|#0202Adv20_AnAn017| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

